<p>Haye akbar, haye akbar..(2)<br> Jo haal dil ka hai na sunoge hussain se?<br> Aap jo dil pe sina kha ke guzar jayenge..(2)<br> hum jo marte bhi na howenge to mar jayenge..(2)</p> 
<p>1. Jaanta hu ke shuja'at hai wirasat teri<br> apne dada ki tarah se hai tabiyat teri<br> tum na janoge magar, baap ki halat akbar..(2)<br> kaise dedu tumhe marne ki ijazat akbar</p> 
<p>2. Noor jata hai tere saath meri aankho'n ka<br> kuch nazar aata nahi mujhko abhi se beta<br> jo gaya saath tere laut ke na aayega..(2)<br> aap ke saath mera dil bhi chala jayega<br> Aap jo dil pe sina..</p> 
<p>3. Ye hi dastoor zamane ka raha hai dilbar<br> baap marta hai to mayyat ko uthata hai pisar<br> tum diye jaate ho humko ghume taaza akbar..(2)<br> humse uthega kaha'n tera janaza akbar<br> Aap jo dil pe sina..</p> 
<p>4. Aap ko barchiya'n khane ki badi jaldi hai<br> jaane kyu jaan se jaane ki badi jaldi hai<br> thehro thehro ke zara kaare ibadat karlu..(2)<br> aakhri baar mai nana ki ziyarat karlu<br> Aap jo dil pe sina..</p> 
<p>5. Ran mein is baat ka ehsaas meri jaan rahe<br> laakh ho josh e wigha fir bhi tumhe dhyan rahe<br> barchi walo'n pe nazar apni jamaye rakhna..(2)<br> apne seene ko mere laal bachaye rakhna<br> Aap jo dil pe sina..</p> 
<p>6. Ek maa hai ke jise sog manana hai tera<br> ek behen hai ke tera dekh rahi hai rasta<br> ek tum ho ke jise jaan lutani hai abhi..(2)<br> ek hum hai ke teri laash uthani hai abhi<br> Aap jo dil pe sina..</p> 
<p>7. Sab se anmol khazina ho mere seene ka<br> ho sabab aap mere laal mere jeene ka<br> saare aalam mein rahe oocha waqar e haider..(2)<br> 100 pisar hote to kar deta nisar e haider<br> Aap jo dil pe sina..</p> 
<p>8. Apne maula ki atao'n se kami koi nahi<br> bus raza ek tamanna hai mere dil mei makee'n<br> meri mehnat ki mujhe bus ye jaza de maula..(2)<br> jab mera nauha sune mujhko dua de maula</p> 
